    <bpmn:process id="W_W274" name="W274. Third-Party Customer Financing / Equipment Leasing" isExecutable="false">
      <bpmn:documentation>Trigger: Customer opts to finance a high-value purchase using a third-party financing partner (e.g., Home Credit) in-store.
Frequency: Daily
Volume: 5-15 per store per day
Owner: Cashier
Participants: Customer, Financing Rep, Store Cashier, Treasury
Source: workflow W274 — Third-Party Customer Financing / Equipment Leasing</bpmn:documentation>
      <bpmn:laneSet id="W274_LaneSet7">
        <bpmn:lane id="W274_Lane1" name="Financing Rep">
        <bpmn:flowNodeRef>W274_Task9</bpmn:flowNodeRef>
        <bpmn:flowNodeRef>W274_Start8</bpmn:flowNodeRef>
        </bpmn:lane>
        <bpmn:lane id="W274_Lane2" name="Financing Partner">
        <bpmn:flowNodeRef>W274_Task10</bpmn:flowNodeRef>
        </bpmn:lane>
        <bpmn:lane id="W274_Lane3" name="Cashier">
        <bpmn:flowNodeRef>W274_Task11</bpmn:flowNodeRef>
        </bpmn:lane>
        <bpmn:lane id="W274_Lane4" name="Customer">
        <bpmn:flowNodeRef>W274_Task12</bpmn:flowNodeRef>
        </bpmn:lane>
        <bpmn:lane id="W274_Lane5" name="Treasury Analyst">
        <bpmn:flowNodeRef>W274_Task13</bpmn:flowNodeRef>
        </bpmn:lane>
        <bpmn:lane id="W274_Lane6" name="Finance Analyst">
        <bpmn:flowNodeRef>W274_Task14</bpmn:flowNodeRef>
        <bpmn:flowNodeRef>W274_End15</bpmn:flowNodeRef>
        </bpmn:lane>
      </bpmn:laneSet>
      <bpmn:startEvent id="W274_Start8" name="Customer opts to finance a high-value purchase using a third-party financing partner…">
        <bpmn:outgoing>W274_Flow18</bpmn:outgoing>
      </bpmn:startEvent>
      <bpmn:userTask id="W274_Task9" name="Customer selects high-value goods (e.g., appliances, power tools) and applies…">
        <bpmn:documentation>Step 1: Customer selects high-value goods (e.g., appliances, power tools) and applies for financing with the in-store financing rep (e.g., Home Credit, CGCC)
Responsible (R): Financing Rep
Accountable (A): —
Duration: 15 min</bpmn:documentation>
        <bpmn:incoming>W274_Flow18</bpmn:incoming>
        <bpmn:outgoing>W274_Flow19</bpmn:outgoing>
      </bpmn:userTask>
      <bpmn:userTask id="W274_Task10" name="Financing partner runs credit check and approves the loan; issues a reference…">
        <bpmn:documentation>Step 2: Financing partner runs credit check and approves the loan; issues a reference code/voucher valid for 24 hours
Responsible (R): Financing Partner
Accountable (A): —
Duration: 10 min</bpmn:documentation>
        <bpmn:incoming>W274_Flow19</bpmn:incoming>
        <bpmn:outgoing>W274_Flow20</bpmn:outgoing>
      </bpmn:userTask>
      <bpmn:userTask id="W274_Task11" name="Cashier rings up the sale on POS, selects &quot;Third-Party Financing&quot; as tender…">
        <bpmn:documentation>Step 3: Cashier rings up the sale on POS, selects &quot;Third-Party Financing&quot; as tender type, and inputs the reference code
Responsible (R): Cashier
Accountable (A): Store Manager
Duration: 5 min</bpmn:documentation>
        <bpmn:incoming>W274_Flow20</bpmn:incoming>
        <bpmn:outgoing>W274_Flow21</bpmn:outgoing>
      </bpmn:userTask>
      <bpmn:userTask id="W274_Task12" name="Customer takes the goods; system records a receivable from the financing…">
        <bpmn:documentation>Step 4: Customer takes the goods; system records a receivable from the financing partner (not from the customer)
Responsible (R): Customer
Accountable (A): —
Duration: —</bpmn:documentation>
        <bpmn:incoming>W274_Flow21</bpmn:incoming>
        <bpmn:outgoing>W274_Flow22</bpmn:outgoing>
      </bpmn:userTask>
      <bpmn:userTask id="W274_Task13" name="Treasury reconciles the batch of financed sales against the remittance from the…">
        <bpmn:documentation>Step 5: Treasury reconciles the batch of financed sales against the remittance from the financing partner (minus MDR of 3-7%) within T+3 business days (W261)
Responsible (R): Treasury Analyst
Accountable (A): Finance Manager
Duration: 2 hours/batch</bpmn:documentation>
        <bpmn:incoming>W274_Flow22</bpmn:incoming>
        <bpmn:outgoing>W274_Flow23</bpmn:outgoing>
      </bpmn:userTask>
      <bpmn:userTask id="W274_Task14" name="Finance posts any MDR variance or unreconciled reference codes to a suspense…">
        <bpmn:documentation>Step 6: Finance posts any MDR variance or unreconciled reference codes to a suspense account for follow-up
Responsible (R): Finance Analyst
Accountable (A): Controller
Duration: 30 min</bpmn:documentation>
        <bpmn:incoming>W274_Flow23</bpmn:incoming>
        <bpmn:outgoing>W274_Flow24</bpmn:outgoing>
      </bpmn:userTask>
      <bpmn:endEvent id="W274_End15" name="Complete">
        <bpmn:incoming>W274_Flow24</bpmn:incoming>
      </bpmn:endEvent>
      <bpmn:textAnnotation id="W274_Annotation16">
        <bpmn:text>Controls: - CTL-266 (ensure controlled execution — Custom Fabrication &amp; Processing (PA-09.1).) | - operational: POS reference-code validation at tender capture (Step 3); operational: T+3 batch reconciliation against partner remittance with suspense-account follow-up (Step 5, W261)
Owner: Cashier</bpmn:text>
      </bpmn:textAnnotation>
      <bpmn:association id="W274_Assoc17" sourceRef="W274_Annotation16" targetRef="W274_Start8" associationDirection="None" />
