    <bpmn:process id="W_W1136" name="W1136. Customer Product Knowledge Video Library &amp; How-To Tutorial Content Management" isExecutable="false">
      <bpmn:documentation>Trigger: Content creation schedule (monthly), new product launch, seasonal topic (e.g., waterproofing before rainy season), or customer FAQ trend
Frequency: ~20–30 new videos/quarter; continuous content management
Volume: Library target: 200–300 videos within Year 1; ~50,000–100,000 monthly views
Owner: Marketing Content Manager (HQ)
Participants: Marketing Content Manager, Category Managers, Sales Associates (on-camera talent), IT Digital Team, Vendor Marketing Partners
Source: workflow W1136 — Customer Product Knowledge Video Library &amp; How-To Tutorial Content Management</bpmn:documentation>
      <bpmn:laneSet id="W1136_LaneSet2">
        <bpmn:lane id="W1136_Lane1" name="Marketing Content Manager">
        <bpmn:flowNodeRef>W1136_Task4</bpmn:flowNodeRef>
        <bpmn:flowNodeRef>W1136_Task5</bpmn:flowNodeRef>
        <bpmn:flowNodeRef>W1136_Task6</bpmn:flowNodeRef>
        <bpmn:flowNodeRef>W1136_Task7</bpmn:flowNodeRef>
        <bpmn:flowNodeRef>W1136_Task8</bpmn:flowNodeRef>
        <bpmn:flowNodeRef>W1136_Start3</bpmn:flowNodeRef>
        <bpmn:flowNodeRef>W1136_End9</bpmn:flowNodeRef>
        </bpmn:lane>
      </bpmn:laneSet>
      <bpmn:startEvent id="W1136_Start3" name="Content creation schedule (monthly), new product launch, seasonal topic (e.g…">
        <bpmn:outgoing>W1136_Flow12</bpmn:outgoing>
      </bpmn:startEvent>
      <bpmn:userTask id="W1136_Task4" name="Content Calendar &amp; Topic Planning">
        <bpmn:documentation>Step 1: Content Calendar &amp; Topic Planning: (a) Marketing Content Manager develops quarterly content calendar aligned with: seasonal relevance (waterproofing in May, aircon sizing in March, Christmas lights in October); new product launches (W564, W1128); customer FAQ trends from call center (W259) and in-store feedback; search analytics (most-searched product categories on buildright.com.ph); vendor co-marketing opportunities; (b) each video planned with: topic, target length (2–8 minutes), target audience (DIY beginner, experienced DIYer, professional), products featured, filming location (store, HQ studio, customer project site), vendor involvement (co-branded content)
Responsible (R): Marketing Content Manager
Accountable (A): CMO
Duration: 2–3 hours/quarter</bpmn:documentation>
        <bpmn:incoming>W1136_Flow12</bpmn:incoming>
        <bpmn:outgoing>W1136_Flow13</bpmn:outgoing>
      </bpmn:userTask>
      <bpmn:userTask id="W1136_Task5" name="Video Production">
        <bpmn:documentation>Step 2: Video Production: (a) filming: in-store product demonstrations, step-by-step installation tutorials, tool comparison reviews; (b) talent: Sales Associates with strong product knowledge and camera presence (identified during training sessions); Category Managers for expert commentary; vendor product specialists for co-branded content; (c) production quality: smartphone or professional camera, external microphone for clear audio, good lighting (ring lights for indoor, reflectors for outdoor), simple editing (titles, overlays, chapter markers); (d) branding: BuildRight logo watermark, intro/outro bumper, &quot;Available at BuildRight Depot&quot; call-to-action overlay; (e) average production time: 4–8 hours per video (including filming, editing, review, revision)
Responsible (R): Marketing Content Manager / Videographer
Accountable (A): Marketing Content Manager
Duration: 4–8 hours/video</bpmn:documentation>
        <bpmn:incoming>W1136_Flow13</bpmn:incoming>
        <bpmn:outgoing>W1136_Flow14</bpmn:outgoing>
      </bpmn:userTask>
      <bpmn:userTask id="W1136_Task6" name="Content Review &amp; Compliance">
        <bpmn:documentation>Step 3: Content Review &amp; Compliance: (a) legal review: ensure no misleading claims, proper disclaimers (&quot;Consult a licensed professional for structural/electrical/plumbing work&quot;), trademark compliance; (b) product accuracy: Category Manager verifies product information, specifications, and pricing; (c) safety review: all tutorials involving power tools, chemicals, or structural work include safety warnings and PPE demonstrations; (d) DTI compliance: no deceptive advertising per Consumer Act RA 7394; (e) accessibility: Filipino and English subtitles/captions for all videos
Responsible (R): Marketing Content Manager / Legal
Accountable (A): CMO
Duration: 1–2 hours/video</bpmn:documentation>
        <bpmn:incoming>W1136_Flow14</bpmn:incoming>
        <bpmn:outgoing>W1136_Flow15</bpmn:outgoing>
      </bpmn:userTask>
      <bpmn:userTask id="W1136_Task7" name="Content Publishing &amp; Distribution">
        <bpmn:documentation>Step 4: Content Publishing &amp; Distribution: (a) videos published on: BuildRight YouTube channel, buildright.com.ph video library, BuildRight mobile app (in product detail pages and dedicated &quot;How-To&quot; section), in-store tablets (for sales associate reference), Facebook and Instagram (short-form clips); (b) SEO optimization: keyword-rich titles, descriptions, and tags per W563; (c) product page integration: relevant videos embedded in product detail pages on ecommerce site; (d) notification: subscribers notified of new content via email and app push notification
Responsible (R): Marketing Content Manager / IT Digital Team
Accountable (A): CMO
Duration: 30–60 min/video</bpmn:documentation>
        <bpmn:incoming>W1136_Flow15</bpmn:incoming>
        <bpmn:outgoing>W1136_Flow16</bpmn:outgoing>
      </bpmn:userTask>
      <bpmn:userTask id="W1136_Task8" name="Performance Tracking &amp; Content Refresh">
        <bpmn:documentation>Step 5: Performance Tracking &amp; Content Refresh: (a) monthly analytics review: views, watch time, engagement rate (likes, comments, shares), click-through to product pages, attributable sales; (b) top-performing videos: promoted more heavily and used as templates for future content; (c) underperforming videos: assessed for topic relevance, thumbnail quality, title optimization; revised or retired; (d) outdated content: products discontinued, pricing changed, or techniques superseded — videos updated or removed; (e) customer feedback: video comments and in-store feedback used to identify new topic opportunities
Responsible (R): Marketing Content Manager
Accountable (A): CMO
Duration: 2–3 hours/month</bpmn:documentation>
        <bpmn:incoming>W1136_Flow16</bpmn:incoming>
        <bpmn:outgoing>W1136_Flow17</bpmn:outgoing>
      </bpmn:userTask>
      <bpmn:endEvent id="W1136_End9" name="Complete">
        <bpmn:incoming>W1136_Flow17</bpmn:incoming>
      </bpmn:endEvent>
      <bpmn:textAnnotation id="W1136_Annotation10">
        <bpmn:text>Controls: - CTL-266 (ensure controlled execution — Custom Fabrication &amp; Processing (PA-09.1).) | - operational: Marketing Content Manager review and approval gate
Owner: Marketing Content Manager (HQ)</bpmn:text>
      </bpmn:textAnnotation>
      <bpmn:association id="W1136_Assoc11" sourceRef="W1136_Annotation10" targetRef="W1136_Start3" associationDirection="None" />
