    <bpmn:process id="W_W1232" name="W1232. Customer In-Store Paint Color Archival, Historic Color Retrieval &amp; Match-from-Sample Service" isExecutable="false">
      <bpmn:documentation>Trigger: Customer brings paint sample (chip, photo, or object) to store for color matching, or requests to retrieve a previously mixed color
Frequency: ~40–60 color match requests per store per month; ~8,000–12,000 requests/month chain-wide
Volume: 200 stores × ~50 matches/month = ~10,000 matches/month; ~120,000/year
Owner: Sales Associate (Paint Section)
Participants: Sales Associate, Department Supervisor (Paint &amp; Finishes), Customer
Source: workflow W1232 — Customer In-Store Paint Color Archival, Historic Color Retrieval &amp; Match-from-Sample Service</bpmn:documentation>
      <bpmn:laneSet id="W1232_LaneSet4">
        <bpmn:lane id="W1232_Lane1" name="Sales Associate">
        <bpmn:flowNodeRef>W1232_Task6</bpmn:flowNodeRef>
        <bpmn:flowNodeRef>W1232_Task7</bpmn:flowNodeRef>
        <bpmn:flowNodeRef>W1232_Task8</bpmn:flowNodeRef>
        <bpmn:flowNodeRef>W1232_Task9</bpmn:flowNodeRef>
        <bpmn:flowNodeRef>W1232_Task11</bpmn:flowNodeRef>
        <bpmn:flowNodeRef>W1232_Start5</bpmn:flowNodeRef>
        </bpmn:lane>
        <bpmn:lane id="W1232_Lane2" name="System">
        <bpmn:flowNodeRef>W1232_Task10</bpmn:flowNodeRef>
        </bpmn:lane>
        <bpmn:lane id="W1232_Lane3" name="Category Manager">
        <bpmn:flowNodeRef>W1232_Task12</bpmn:flowNodeRef>
        <bpmn:flowNodeRef>W1232_End13</bpmn:flowNodeRef>
        </bpmn:lane>
      </bpmn:laneSet>
      <bpmn:startEvent id="W1232_Start5" name="Customer brings paint sample (chip, photo, or object) to store for color matching, or…">
        <bpmn:outgoing>W1232_Flow16</bpmn:outgoing>
      </bpmn:startEvent>
      <bpmn:userTask id="W1232_Task6" name="Customer request intake">
        <bpmn:documentation>Step 1: Customer request intake: Sales Associate determines request type: (a) match from sample (paint chip, object, photo); (b) retrieve historic color (customer knows previous purchase details); (c) match competitor color (brand + color name/code)
Responsible (R): Sales Associate
Accountable (A): —
Duration: 2 min</bpmn:documentation>
        <bpmn:incoming>W1232_Flow16</bpmn:incoming>
        <bpmn:outgoing>W1232_Flow17</bpmn:outgoing>
      </bpmn:userTask>
      <bpmn:userTask id="W1232_Task7" name="Historic color retrieval">
        <bpmn:documentation>Step 2: Historic color retrieval: If customer has previous order reference: (a) search by customer loyalty number, transaction date, or receipt number in POS history; (b) system retrieves previous custom paint formula (base + colorant codes and volumes); (c) verify formula matches customer&#x27;s physical sample (visual comparison under store lighting); (d) if match confirmed: proceed to mixing per W168
Responsible (R): Sales Associate
Accountable (A): —
Duration: 5 min</bpmn:documentation>
        <bpmn:incoming>W1232_Flow17</bpmn:incoming>
        <bpmn:outgoing>W1232_Flow18</bpmn:outgoing>
      </bpmn:userTask>
      <bpmn:userTask id="W1232_Task8" name="Color matching from sample">
        <bpmn:documentation>Step 3: Color matching from sample: If no historic record: (a) use spectrophotometer (color scanner) to read customer&#x27;s sample; (b) system calculates closest color formula from paint brand&#x27;s colorant library; (c) Sales Associate verifies match visually (sample vs. system recommendation); (d) small test batch (50ml) mixed for customer approval before full can
Responsible (R): Sales Associate
Accountable (A): —
Duration: 10–15 min</bpmn:documentation>
        <bpmn:incoming>W1232_Flow18</bpmn:incoming>
        <bpmn:outgoing>W1232_Flow19</bpmn:outgoing>
      </bpmn:userTask>
      <bpmn:userTask id="W1232_Task9" name="Competitor color cross-reference">
        <bpmn:documentation>Step 4: Competitor color cross-reference: If customer provides competitor brand + color code: (a) system looks up cross-reference table (maintained per W252 item master — competitor-to-BuildRight color mapping); (b) if exact match exists: retrieve formula; (c) if no exact match: use spectrophotometer on customer&#x27;s sample per step 3
Responsible (R): Sales Associate
Accountable (A): —
Duration: 5 min</bpmn:documentation>
        <bpmn:incoming>W1232_Flow19</bpmn:incoming>
        <bpmn:outgoing>W1232_Flow20</bpmn:outgoing>
      </bpmn:userTask>
      <bpmn:serviceTask id="W1232_Task10" name="Color archival">
        <bpmn:documentation>Step 5: Color archival: Upon successful match and customer approval: (a) system saves color formula with unique color ID; (b) link to customer&#x27;s loyalty account (if registered); (c) record: base paint SKU, colorant codes, volumes per colorant, final RGB/LAB values; (d) customer receives printed color card with formula code for future reference
Responsible (R): System / Sales Associate
Accountable (A): —
Duration: 2 min</bpmn:documentation>
        <bpmn:incoming>W1232_Flow20</bpmn:incoming>
        <bpmn:outgoing>W1232_Flow21</bpmn:outgoing>
      </bpmn:serviceTask>
      <bpmn:userTask id="W1232_Task11" name="Paint mixing &amp; sale">
        <bpmn:documentation>Step 6: Paint mixing &amp; sale: Mix approved formula per W168; process sale at POS per W5B
Responsible (R): Sales Associate
Accountable (A): Department Supervisor
Duration: Per W168</bpmn:documentation>
        <bpmn:incoming>W1232_Flow21</bpmn:incoming>
        <bpmn:outgoing>W1232_Flow22</bpmn:outgoing>
      </bpmn:userTask>
      <bpmn:userTask id="W1232_Task12" name="Quarterly color data analytics">
        <bpmn:documentation>Step 7: Quarterly color data analytics: Category Manager reviews: (a) most popular custom colors by region; (b) color match accuracy rate (customer returns/complaints); (c) competitor brand match frequency (competitive intelligence); (d) tinting machine calibration compliance per W1130
Responsible (R): Category Manager
Accountable (A): VP Merchandising
Duration: 2 hours/quarter</bpmn:documentation>
        <bpmn:incoming>W1232_Flow22</bpmn:incoming>
        <bpmn:outgoing>W1232_Flow23</bpmn:outgoing>
      </bpmn:userTask>
      <bpmn:endEvent id="W1232_End13" name="Complete">
        <bpmn:incoming>W1232_Flow23</bpmn:incoming>
      </bpmn:endEvent>
      <bpmn:textAnnotation id="W1232_Annotation14">
        <bpmn:text>Controls: - CTL-266 (ensure controlled execution — Custom Fabrication &amp; Processing (PA-09.1).) | - operational: Sales Associate (Paint Section) review and approval gate
Owner: Sales Associate (Paint Section)</bpmn:text>
      </bpmn:textAnnotation>
